---@field GeneralLogGroup? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The location of the CloudWatch Logs log group where general logs are sent.
---@field Pending? aws.securityhub.AwsAmazonMqBrokerLogsPendingDetails The list of information about logs that are to be turned on for the specified broker.

---Provides information about logs to be activated for the specified broker.
