---@field CertificateArn? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) for the SSL certificate that encrypts connections between the DMS endpoint and the replication instance.
---@field DatabaseName? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The name of the endpoint database.
