---@field EndpointIdentifier? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The database endpoint identifier.
---@field EndpointType? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The type of endpoint. Valid values are source and target.
---@field EngineName? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The type of engine for the endpoint, depending on the EndpointType value.
