---@field ReplicationTaskSettings? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The settings for the replication task.
---@field SourceEndpointArn? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The ARN of the source endpoint.
---@field TableMappings? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The table mappings for the replication task, in JSON format.
---@field TargetEndpointArn? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The ARN of the target endpoint.
---@field TaskData? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString Supplemental information that the task requires to migrate the data for certain source and target endpoints.

