---@field NoteUpdatedAt? aws.securityhub.DateFilterList The timestamp of when the note was updated.
---@field NoteUpdatedBy? aws.securityhub.StringFilterList The principal that created a note.
---@field Keyword? aws.securityhub.KeywordFilterList A keyword for a finding.
