---@field OverallSeverity? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The highest severity for the patches. Valid values are as follows:
---@field NonCompliantMediumCount? aws.securityhub.Integer For the patches that are noncompliant, the number that have a severity of MEDIUM.
---@field NonCompliantUnspecifiedCount? aws.securityhub.Integer For the patches that are noncompliant, the number that have a severity of UNSPECIFIED.
