---A resource related to a finding.
---@class aws.securityhub.Resource
---@field Type aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The type of the resource that details are provided for. If possible, set Type to one of the supported resource types. For example, if the resource is an EC2 instance, then set Type to AwsEc2Instance.
