---@field Region aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The Amazon Web Services Region that recorded the resource data in Security Hub.
---@field ResourceId aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The unique identifier for a resource.
---@field ResourceProvider? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The cloud provider where the resource exists. Valid values are AWS and Azure.
---@field ResourceOwnerOrgId? aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The identifier of the cloud organization that owns the resource. For Amazon Web Services resources, this is the Organizations ID. For Azure resources, this is the Azure tenant ID.
