---Provides details about a control's enablement status in a specified standard.
---@class aws.securityhub.StandardsControlAssociationDetail
---@field StandardsArn aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of a security standard.
---@field SecurityControlId aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The unique identifier of a security control across standards. Values for this field typically consist of an Amazon Web Services service name and a number, such as APIGateway.3.
---@field SecurityControlArn aws.securityhub.NonEmptyString The ARN of a security control across standards, such as arn:aws:securityhub:eu-central-1:123456789012:security-control/S3.1. This parameter doesn't mention a specific standard.
